  "details": "If user is under 18, they cannot manually enable \"Extreme Horror\" Content Gating filter.\n\nFor all users under 18, Content Gating Filters are forced on except for \"Extreme Horror\" ( as announced in the [Developer Update](https://ask.vrchat.com/t/developer-update-22-november-2023/20878#h-202342-open-beta-6) ) and cannot be turned off.\n\nThis indicates that Content Gating Filters is implemented so that users under 18 cannot change the settings themselves, and this is why \"Extreme Horror\" filter cannot be enabled.\n\nIn the Developer Update, you said \"because I don’t think we defined that tag very well and people are over-applying it.\", but I think it would be better to have the option to enable it manually (as with 18 and above).\n\nI have not checked with Quest and Pico, but probably the same.",
